  "id": "Hackney-2025_0894",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The provision and facilitation of off-street parking spaces at a site with PTAL 3 rating through a dropped kerb fails to promote sustainable modes of transport and does not promote car free residential development, contrary to London Plan (2021) Policy T6.1 (Residential parking) and Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) Policies&amp;nbsp;LP43 (Transport and Development) and LP45 (Parking and Car Free Development).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The dropped kerb and vehicle crossover, by reason of facilitating vehicles manoeuvring in and/or out of the site in reverse gear, over the public footway adjacent to a cycle lane , would have a detrimental impact on highway and pedestrian safety and the safe and efficient operation of the public highway. As such the proposal is contrary to London Plan (2021) Policy T4 (Assessing and mitigating transport impacts) and Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) Policies LP41 (Livable Neighbourhoods), LP43 (Transport and Development) and LP44 (Public Transport and Infrastructure).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-d768f8f6-7fff-1b49-789a-cd510f385095&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed dropped kerb, by reason of its scale, design and location, would result in an incongruous, incompatible and obtrusive form of development that would result in a detrimental impact on the character and appearance of the streetscene. As such, the proposal would not preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the Victoria Park Conservation Area and would be contrary to Hackney&#x27;s Local Plan 2033 (adopted 2020) Policies LP1 (High Quality Design) and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets), London Plan Policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity Through The Design-Led Approach) and HC1 (Heritage Conservation and Growth) and Hackney&#x27;s  REsidential Extensions and Alterations SPG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
